{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "F4SLLJUJQQQAT4NAYSLNB3DPY5XCVKJX",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041141001",
    "title": "運命の声を聞け！",
    "enTitle": "Heed the Voice of Fate!",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "超新星爆発。",
            "enText": "A supernova.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 52,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 5976702272422812242,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "それはひとつの巨星の終焉。しかしその爆発は、眩むほどの光で\n全宇宙を照らし――千の星々を育む、ゆりかごとなる。",
            "enText": "The end of a star. An explosion that created a blinding \nlight that reached the ends of the universe――and then \nbecoming the sustenance for a thousand new stars.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 131,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -7513667187723868155,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "この宇宙でも、ある時凄まじい超新星爆発が起こった。\nあまりにも強烈なその爆発は――レースそのものを変えた。",
            "enText": "At one time, in this universe, there was a tremendous supernova. \nAn incredibly powerful shock――that changed racing itself.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 129,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3568812969334588233,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "信じられない末脚を持ったウマ娘たちが登場した。彼女たちに\n憧れた子も多数現れ、激しいスピード勝負が主流となりだした。",
            "enText": "Uma Musume with unimaginable closing strength appeared. And many girls \ncame to admire them, with such high-speed battles becoming the norm.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 135,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 237,
                    "pathId": -8295842150510788087
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 239,
                    "pathId": 1719498727638568559
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6548497445957810220,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "更にその脚を磨き上げたような、衝撃的な瞬発力でレースを\n制するウマ娘たちも台頭し――今、新たな中心となりつつある。",
            "enText": "As if they had honed their legs to the limits of perfection, \nUma Musume with such explosive acceleration had come to \ndominate――And now, they were emerging as the new center.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 134,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -6895785619308007791
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 959361399047763281
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": -2618971788528963923
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 333,
                    "pathId": 7280258687850272718
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4517544004287136979,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "しかし、星はひとつではない。ある路線で絶大な輝きを誇る星、\n海外にまで光を届ける星……夜空には多くの煌めきが浮かんでいる。",
            "enText": "However, there isn't just a single star. One of those \nstars shined brilliantly, even reaching overseas…… \nAnd many more began to shimmer in that night sky.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 139,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": -1291222508485486723
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 27,
                    "pathId": -2329922691214275912
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4113627196668508126,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ひと際輝くその星が、どんな爆発を巻き起こすのかは――\n宇宙さえも、知らない。",
            "enText": "Just what kind of supernova would that brilliant star trigger? \n――Even the universe didn't know.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": 819119983808569199
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": 7770574874769102216
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3337347571917225743,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "新人トレーナーとして、ウマ娘のために学ぶべきことは無限にある。\n成長のため、URA主催の特別講義を受講しに来た。すると――",
            "enText": "As a rookie trainer, there was an endless amount to learn \nfor the sake of Uma Musume. For my own personal growth, I \nwas here to attend a special lecture organized by the URA.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（……なんでウマ娘がここに？）",
                    "enText": "(……Why is an Uma Musume here?)",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 2193442668436384657
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": 632588271348282709
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 9156695491393982286
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -829648895760861160
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7770699134018661122,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そっと入ってきたのは、トレセン学園のウマ娘だった。この講義は、\nトレーナーがウマ娘への適切な指導を学ぶためのものなのだが……。",
            "enText": "An Uma Musume from Tracen Academy quietly entered. \nI thought this lecture was intended for trainers \nto learn how to properly guide Uma Musume, but……",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 127,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（というかあの子――シーザリオだ……！）",
                    "enText": "(Wait, that girl――She's Cesario……!)",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 2961856867973843093
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": -5493655959797137858
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9043242976818615716,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は日本でオークスウマ娘となった後、日本のウマ娘として\n史上初めて『アメリカンオークス』を勝利する偉業を成し遂げた。",
            "enText": "After becoming an Oaks Uma Musume in Japan, she went on to \nbecome the first Japanese Uma Musume to win the 『American Oaks』",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（その後は、ずっと休養中だったはず……）",
                    "enText": "(Since then, she's been on break……)",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -4541782631201244406
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 8180566502440307244
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 6321144312594187877
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7957347308337180890,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "――ええ、そうなんです。ケガの休養が長引いてしまって……\nそれで、そのあいだに……次の夢に向けて、準備をしようかと。",
            "enText": "――Yes, that's right. Recovering from my injury is \ntaking longer than expected……So, in the meantime…… \nI thought I'd start preparing for the next dream I have.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 407,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "その夢って……",
                    "enText": "And that dream is……",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 416,
                    "pathId": -8262730898994146667
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -1903224542702139668
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 17,
                    "pathId": -3909225830347269497
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9187513568300684077,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "未来を、育むことです。そのために、指導の勉強を少しずつ\n始めていて……今回の講義にも、特別に許可を頂いて参加しました。",
            "enText": "It's about nurturing the future. And for that, little \nby little, I'm learning how to teach……And for this \nlecture, I've received special permission to attend.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 439,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そうか、君は努力家だな",
                    "enText": "I see, you're quite the hard worker",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、貴方は努力家だね",
                    "enText": "I see, you're quite the hard worker",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 416,
                    "pathId": -9117213465769085143
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -6990155090754326283
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7418370289998091667,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "いえ……未熟さを補うために、必死なだけです。\n……わかっていましたけど、本当に難しいんですね、指導って。",
            "enText": "No……I'm just desperately trying to make up for \nmy inexperience. ……I knew it already, but it's \ntruly difficult, isn't it? Instructing others.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 377,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もしかしてもう、誰かを指導してるのか？",
                    "enText": "Are you already teaching someone?",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "もしかしてもう、誰かを指導してるの？",
                    "enText": "Are you already teaching someone?",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 7297793476764224186
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 214,
                    "pathId": -2121642138235440112
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6493016915230533573,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "はい、何名か。ただ、その中におひとり……なんといいますか、\n凄まじい個性を持つ方がいまして……。",
            "enText": "Yes, a few. But, among them there's one……how should I put it, \nthere's someone with an incredibly unique personality……",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 355,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 373,
                    "pathId": 2240887890888461042
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 194,
                    "pathId": 4205938896297345538
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6460608080927504439,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "???",
            "jpText": "うおああああああああああ！！！！",
            "enText": "Uwoooooooooaaaaaa!!!!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 92,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 7712280406091742978
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -1819156495990131644
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": 2384805013520854692
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 938490094231293603,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "???",
            "jpText": "もっと！　もっと……加速だっ！\nその方がいい、そうに決まってる！　いっくぞおおおおーー！！",
            "enText": "More! More……acceleration! \nThat way's better, it has to be the way! Let's gooooo――!!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 272,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（な、なんてパワフルな……！）",
                    "enText": "(H-how powerful……!)",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 101,
                    "pathId": 4843518539676810444
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": 2734828203903913181
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8376592187987771465,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "芝が勢いよく蹴り上げられていく。彼女の全身から、有り余る力が\n放出されているような……爆発的なエネルギーを感じた。",
            "enText": "Quite a bit of turf was being kicked up. It was almost as if power was \noverflowing from her entire body……I could feel the explosive energy.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": -3313752087212701503
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6685665843448821117,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "ああ、また……！\n待っていて下さいと、お伝えしたんですが……。",
            "enText": "Ahhh, again……! \nEven though I told her to wait for me……",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "じゃあ、彼女が――",
                    "enText": "Then, that girl――",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": 1979832254371056793
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 225,
                    "pathId": 5281228402268414059
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 32,
                    "pathId": -8737459739422681125
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5215159143694374190,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "はい。私が指導させていただいている――\nエピファネイアさんです。",
            "enText": "Yes. She's one of the girls I'm \ncurrently teaching――Epiphaneia-san.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 168,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "エピファネイア……――",
                    "enText": "Epiphaneia……――",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 5258575723680713546
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": 8307076848543727705
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 226,
                    "pathId": -2288697758805031092
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1863588759427902880,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "！\n今……聞こえた！",
            "enText": "! Just now……I heard it!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 117,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": -7882756251684381229
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": -4405730117479537737
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5600344812310973841,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――こっちだ！",
            "enText": "――This way!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 36,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 808517003403685858
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4699600893244514274
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1747679183229472868,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "ええっ、私とのトレーニングは……！？",
            "enText": "Eeeeeh, what about training with me……!?",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 96,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……追いかけよう！",
                    "enText": "……Let's go after her!",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -2976190791101774846
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6611792977726911911,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――気がつけば、シーザリオとともに駆けだしていた。\n理由はわからない。ただ……――",
            "enText": "――Before I realized it, I was chasing after \nher with Cesario. I didn't know why. Just……――",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（あの走り、すごく気になる……！）",
                    "enText": "(That run, I'm really curious……!)",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 63,
                    "pathId": 837701847081254883
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6340527394897612179
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8854535811200851602,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "――あ！　見つけました！\nあそこ、2階部分に……！",
            "enText": "――Ah! I found her! \nThere, on the second floor……!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 135,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "本当だ……！",
                    "enText": "It's her……!",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": -6094134918183628286
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": -8474776318811668310
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3306153580084424074,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "んー？　どこだ？\nいや――わかったぞ、こっちだ！",
            "enText": "Hm? Where? \nNo――I got it, over here!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 184,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": 8902244958751640058
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": 5956180157115907745
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -495822486179529718
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -8077288684020229603
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 221021371550082906,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "あ――",
            "enText": "Ah――",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 76,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 207,
                    "pathId": -7463282697330394342
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 111110334337706349
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4762365269964325684,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "目の前で、火花が爆ぜた。\n――そう感じるほど、勢いよく視線がぶつかった。",
            "enText": "When our eyes met, sparks flew. \n――Our gazes clashed with such intensity that it felt that way anyways.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 161,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（彗星みたいな、瞳――）",
                    "enText": "(Eyes almost like comets――)",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 1825073515331693787
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": 4107251404804153402
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6306722921568664565,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――そうか！\nキミなんだな！",
            "enText": "――I see! \nIt's you, isn't it!?",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 82,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -6864270077006021193
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 104,
                    "pathId": 5952923639707366390
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4994925618560880515,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "待っててくれ、そっちに降りる！",
